<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Flat brand-sand splash. The old pre-rendered PNGs (down to 320x480) were
     CENTER_CROP-upscaled to fill modern screens, so the mark rendered soft and
     looked nothing like the in-app loader. A flat colour + the plugin's
     terracotta spinner flows seamlessly into the brand loading animation. -->
